{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>\n\t\t\t選舉委員會界別分組選舉結果陸續公布，建築、測量、都市規劃及園境界15名當選人分別是林雲峯、陳澤斌、何鉅業、劉興達、林家輝、呂慶耀、林力山、林展鵬、賴旭輝、張綺薇、陳旭明、黎漢群、杜嘉儀、張翹楚、李少穎。<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n編輯：黃佩珊\t\t</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-22T13:43:45.443741+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":108,"images":0,"source":"RTHK 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-22T13:26:52+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-22T14:57:27.195645+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-22T13:37:22.560037+00:00","content_hash":"13bf1049aa4e8eeb8856d3ed793742eed9f4bfb83c030c9f15a4db882b0c740e","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}